    "plot": "It is 03:30 PM on a chaotic Saturday afternoon at the Miller home. At 06:00 PM sharp, Dad's wealthy, tyrannical mother Grandma Evelyn arrives for dinner inspection. If the house is not spotless and the casserole is not baking inside Grandma's sacred Ming porcelain dish, she will evict the Millers and ship Grandpa Joe off to the Shady Pines nursing home. Ten-year-old Jack must lure Mom out of her office, recover Dad's golden wrench from a piranha tank, ward off annoying neighbor Kevin with Dad's 'Sports Magazines', glue the shattered Ming dish, bake the casserole, and uncover the hilarious truth behind Grandpa Joe's kitchen sabotage to blackmail Grandma with her own prenup contract and poolboy photos!",
    "rules": "Every turn advances the clock by 3 minutes. At 04:00 (30m elapsed), neighbor Kevin shows up and randomly wastes 3 extra minutes when changing rooms until Jack gives him the Sports Magazines. Jack must complete all four victory conditions before 06:00 (120m elapsed): fix the sink, get rid of Kevin, bake the spiced casserole in the glued Ming dish, and set the Poolboy Blackmail Dossier trap.",
    "intro_text": "It is 03:30 PM on Saturday afternoon, and the Miller family kitchen looks like a disaster zone. Dirty dishes tower over the counter, murky water drips steadily from the clogged sink pipe onto the linoleum floor, and the wall clock ticks away mercilessly. In exactly two hours  - at 06:00 PM sharp - Grandma Evelyn arrives with her white inspection gloves and an eviction notice.\n\nRight here in the kitchen, your father is wedged halfway under the sink pipe, sweating through his polo shirt and muttering in total panic because he cannot find his prized golden wrench. The door to Mom's office next to the ##FRIDGE is locked tight from the inside as Mom sobs into her phone, leaving ten-year-old you as the sole crisis manager left standing.",
    "completed_condition": "When Grandma arrives at 06:00 PM (or earlier via the kitchen wall clock), the kitchen sink is repaired, Kevin is gone, the spiced casserole is baking in the glued Ming dish, and the Blackmail Dossier is ready for her.",
    "gameover_condition": "The clock reaches 06:00 PM before all preparations and the blackmail trap are complete, or Jack loses the game.",
    "completed_guard_expression": "tw.vars.get('grandma_showdown_won', False)",
    "gameover_guard_expression": "tw.vars.get('grandma_failed', False)",
    "tts_director_notes": "",
