      "inventory": [],
      "hp_change": 0,
      "stamina_change": 0,
      "mana_change": 0,
      "text_log_content": "CODE RED EMERGENCY!! I only picked up Grandma Evelyn's sacred Ming casserole dish to wipe the dust off, and it literally SNAPPED IN HALF in my hands! Did I squeeze it too hard?! There are strange scrape marks on the handle... but Evelyn will NEVER believe me! She'll claim breach of trust, evict Arthur and me, and cancel our family insurance! I can't face her. I'm locking myself in here with my yoga tapes until the moving truck arrives. If anyone reads this: tell Arthur I loved him, even with his absurd mancave and piranhas.",
      "text_log_format": "NOTE"
    },
